---
title: "03 - Activity Diagram Kelola Data Kategori (CRUD) - Fork Node"
---
flowchart TD
    classDef admin fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#3b82f6
    classDef system fill:#d1fae5,stroke:#10b981
    classDef action fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#f59e0b
    classDef fork fill:#fde68a,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:3px

    Start([Mulai]):::admin

    Start --> A1[A1: Admin membuka&lt;br/&gt;menu Kategori]:::admin
    A1 --> S1[S1: Sistem tampilkan&lt;br/&gt;seluruh data kategori]:::system
    S1 --> A2{A2: Admin pilih&lt;br/&gt;aksi}:::action

    %% AKSI TAMBAH (fork/join, no decision)
    A2 -->|Tambah| A3[A3: Isi formulir tambah]:::admin
    A3 --> Fork1((Fork)):::fork
    Fork1 --> S2[S2: Validasi data&lt;br/&gt;formulir]:::system
    Fork1 --> S3[S3: Cek unik&lt;br/&gt;kode_kategori]:::system
    S2 --> Join1((Join)):::fork
    S3 --> Join1
    Join1 --> S4[S4: Simpan data&lt;br/&gt;kategori baru ke DB]:::system
    S4 --> S5[S5: Tampil notifikasi&lt;br/&gt;sukses]:::system
    S5 --> Selesai

    %% AKSI EDIT (fork/join)
    A2 -->|Edit| A4[A4: Isi formulir edit]:::admin
    A4 --> Fork2((Fork)):::fork
    Fork2 --> S6[S6: Validasi&lt;br/&gt;perubahan data]:::system
    Fork2 --> S7[S7: Ambil data lama&lt;br/&gt;dari DB]:::system
    S6 --> Join2((Join)):::fork
    S7 --> Join2
    Join2 --> S8[S8: Simpan perubahan&lt;br/&gt;ke DB]:::system
    S8 --> S9[S9: Tampil notifikasi&lt;br/&gt;sukses]:::system
    S9 --> Selesai

    %% AKSI HAPUS (1 decision - validasi kondisional)
    A2 -->|Hapus| S10[S10: Tampil konfirmasi&lt;br/&gt;hapus]:::system
    S10 --> A5{A5: Admin&lt;br/&gt;konfirmasi?}:::action
    A5 -->|Tidak| Selesai
    A5 -->|Ya| S11{S11: Kategori&lt;br/&gt;masih dipakai&lt;br/&gt;barang?}:::action
    S11 -->|Ya| S12[S12: Tampil pesan&lt;br/&gt;tidak dapat dihapus]:::system
    S12 --> Selesai
    S11 -->|Tidak| S13[S13: Soft delete&lt;br/&gt;data kategori]:::system
    S13 --> S14[S14: Tampil notifikasi&lt;br/&gt;sukses]:::system
    S14 --> Selesai([Selesai]):::admin
